# Pipeline outputs — chapter audio + diagrams + extraction JSON are
# committed so teammates can `lecture-pipeline-v2 load-extraction <path>`
# without re-running ingestion. Heavier ephemeral artifacts (animations,
# runs, measurement cache, phase-checkpoint outputs) stay ignored.
